### integration

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"type integration = (f64 -> f64) -> f64 -> f64 -> f64\n\ninl integral dt : integration =\n    fun f a b =>\n        inl rec 루프 t y =\n            if t < b\n            then 루프 (t + dt) (y + f t * dt)\n            else t, y\n        루프 (a + dt / 2) 0\n        |> snd","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  type integration = (f64 -> f64) -> f64 -> f64 -> f64

  inl integral dt : integration =
      fun f a b =>
          inl rec 루프 t y =
              if t < b
              then 루프 (t + dt) (y + f t * dt)
              else t, y
          루프 (a + dt / 2) 0
          |> snd
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n\nintegral 0.01 math.square 0 1\n|> _assert_approx_eq None 0.33332500000000004","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test

