### velocity_fv

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl newton_second_v m fs v0 =\n    fs |> listm.map (fun f => f v0) |> listm'.sum |> fun x => x / m\n\ninl update_velocity dt m fs v0 =\n    v0 + newton_second_v m fs v0 * dt\n\ninl velocity_fv dt m v0 fs t =\n    stream.iterate (update_velocity dt m fs) v0\n    |> stream.try_item (t / dt |> math.round |> abs)\n    |> optionm'.default_value 0","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl newton_second_v m fs v0 =
      fs |> listm.map (fun f => f v0) |> listm'.sum |> fun x => x / m

  inl update_velocity dt m fs v0 =
      v0 + newton_second_v m fs v0 * dt

  inl velocity_fv dt m v0 fs t =
      stream.iterate (update_velocity dt m fs) v0
      |> stream.try_item (t / dt |> math.round |> abs)
      |> optionm'.default_value 0
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl f_air drag rho area v =\n    -drag * rho * area * abs v * v / 2","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl f_air drag rho area v =
      -drag * rho * area * abs v * v / 2
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

