#### vec_derivative

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"type vec_derivative = (f64 -> vec) -> f64 -> vec\n\ninl vec_derivative dt : vec_derivative =\n    fun v t =>\n        (v (t + dt / 2) ^-^ v (t - dt / 2)) ^/ dt","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  type vec_derivative = (f64 -> vec) -> f64 -> vec

  inl vec_derivative dt : vec_derivative =
      fun v t =>
          (v (t + dt / 2) ^-^ v (t - dt / 2)) ^/ dt
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
